{"ID":"20240513083017-q237bt8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083017-q237bt8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083017-q237bt8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172531-gap2ina\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172531-gap2ina\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172531-gap2ina\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:290,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:290\u0026#125;","title":"297","type":"doc","updated":"20240514175043"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513172531-gap2ina","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 732px;","id":"20240513172531-gap2ina","updated":"20240514175043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008-5-15"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"220-3 L, D"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中老年  很胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008-5-16"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：病人因爲不能平躺。胸膈不舒服而來診。這個症狀已經有幾個月了。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、睡眠好，不能平躺。\n2、服藥(大陷胸湯)後每兩小時下利一次。\n3、鼻子有涕水倒流入喉中。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡黃濕\n2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷：肺中濁痰，造成鼻阻塞。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、噴鼻粉(麝香礬石粉，通竅化濕)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、皀莢丸80粒，每次40粒。用大棗粉沖服。（病人有吸煙，胸中有粘痰），一天一劑，每天晚餐後服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"皀莢丸能化粘痰爲稀痰然後瀉出來。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}